# 10
h1(d, "10  Decision and issue log")
log = [
 ("Network blocked.", "Downloads from GitHub raw, World Bank and Ember failed with 403 CONNECT rejections. Proxy documentation says not to route around policy denials. Resolution: the author downloaded and attached the two files; the World Bank file was made optional because OWID already carries GDP and population."),
 ("statsmodels unavailable.", "pip could not reach PyPI (DNS failure). Resolution: implemented estimators with numpy and scipy (Appendix F)."),
 ("Cluster-regression crash.", "A Kenya-only regression called the clustered-SE routine with one cluster (division by zero). Resolution: Kenya-only uses classical OLS; pooled uses clustered SEs."),
 ("Ensemble membership.", "Initial four-member ensemble included the two weakest models. Changed after backtest evidence; disclosed as a selection effect (Section 5.5)."),
 ("First Monte Carlo was uninformative.", "Resampling year-on-year hydro changes included growth years and produced a 0% shortfall probability, understating risk. Redesigned to resample deviations from the centred five-year mean and to condition on the import state. Results changed materially (27% shortfall probability with imports out)."),
 ("Scenario calibration.", "The 'severe' drought was first set at −45% by assumption. Data showed the 2000 deviation was −42%, so S2 was recalibrated to −42% and renamed '2000-type drought'."),
 ("Fact-check of draft text.", "Draft statements were verified against the data. Corrections made: demand fell in four years (2007, 2008, 2013, 2016), not two; Sudan's per-capita demand exceeds Kenya's; concentration (HHI) is 0.5–0.9 for all neighbours except Rwanda; the claim that heavy import weighting would lower Kenya's rank was quantified (rank 7)."),
 ("Capacity data.", "Zero geothermal capacity in Ember meant capacity-based reserve margins were dropped from the security index and replaced by energy-based pillars."),
 ("Figure layout.", "Stress chart legend and labels overlapped; fixed by moving the legend below the plot and adding label backgrounds. Supply-mix colours changed so fossil is grey."),
 ("Pagination.", "Chapter 2 overflowed by one bullet onto a near-empty page; tightened. Final Report is 25 pages.")]
for a, b in log: para(d, b, bold_lead=a, after=4)

