h2(d, "12.2  Extensions")
bullets(d, ["Add monthly data (generation, peak demand, reservoir levels) to move from annual energy to seasonal adequacy.", "Add cost data (tariffs, fuel prices, levelised costs) to convert the capacity gap to investment needs.", "Replace the heuristic ensemble with a formal forecast-combination study when longer or monthly series are available.", "Add a dashboard (Streamlit) that refreshes the monitoring indicators in Table 11 of the Final Report."])

# Appendices - code
